// How many kept pairs have a labeled margin strictly between the ends.
// No pair returns nothing. One margin returns nothing in the middle.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE mmid ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE rank  ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG mmid rank

IMPULSE mmid 1
IMPULSE rank 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY rank
DECIDE rank
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "mmid" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
